@startuml EquipmentRental_Public_Seq

title Sequence Diagram - Equipment Rental (Public)

actor User
participant "App" as App
participant System
database DB

User -> App: Buka katalog equipment
App -> DB: Query available equipment
DB --> App: Return list
App --> User: Tampilkan katalog

User -> App: Pilih equipment
App -> DB: Query detail + price
DB --> App: Return details
App --> User: Tampilkan detail

User -> App: Isi form (tanggal, durasi)
App -> System: Check availability
System -> DB: Query existing rentals
DB --> System: Return rentals
System -> System: Check conflict
System --> App: Available/not

alt Available
  App --> User: Show total price
else Not available
  App --> User: Show error
end

User -> App: Checkout
User -> App: Input data + payment method
App --> User: Show summary

User -> App: Confirm & Pay
App -> System: Process payment

alt Payment OK
  System -> DB: Create rental record
  System -> App: Send email
  App --> User: Show rental code
else Payment failed
  App --> User: Show error
end

@enduml
